sequenceDiagram
    participant Rating as Rating Service
    participant Kafka as foc.user.rating
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Rating->>Kafka: user.rating.updated, key is the user id
    Kafka->>Badges: userId, newAverage, totalRatings
    alt other eventType or fails the schema
        Badges-->>Kafka: skip, and log when invalid
    else stored rating_count is already at least totalRatings
        Badges-->>Kafka: stale, nothing changes
    else newer
        Badges->>DB: upsert average_rating and rating_count
        Badges->>DB: re-check that user's badges
    end
